        "- Application URL / base URL for the feature entry page and destination.",

        "- Feature entry page URL and destination URL.",

        "- Valid test credentials (identifier + credential) for a pre-existing entity.",

        "- API endpoints for the feature, if the feature is API-based.",

        "- Whether a database is actually required for the feature (project adapter disables it, but data storage may need it).",

