        "## 13. Blockers for Specification",

        "",

        "Items that must be resolved before the specification stage can produce reliable coverage. These are not necessarily blockers for the grill completing — the grill completes with open questions — but they block meaningful specification.",

        "",

        "- **Interaction mechanism undefined:** Specification cannot define coverage level (UI vs API vs both) until the feature integration point is confirmed. This affects test level selection.",

