        f"*QA Grill performed by qa-run runtime. Report is grounded in story-intake.md, discovery/output.md, analysis/output.md, and project.yaml only. No business rules, URLs, credentials, selectors, API contracts, database schemas, environments, or integrations were invented. Clarification questions are generated for human stakeholders to answer — they are not answered here.*",

    ])



    content = "\n".join(grill_lines)

    art1 = write_stage_artifact(story_id, "grill/output.md", content)



    questions_text = (

        "## 9. Clarification Questions\n\n"

        "The following questions should be answered by a human stakeholder or product owner before specification begins.\n\n"

        "Q1: Is the feature interaction performed via a web form POST, a REST API call, or both? (Tied to: Ambiguity — interaction mechanism unknown; Missing requirement — interaction mechanism not specified)\n"

        "Q2: Is there a separate entity setup flow, or are entities pre-existing in the system? (Tied to: Missing requirement — registration flow not specified; Ambiguity — 'a pre-existing entity exists' precondition)\n"

        "Q3: What are the valid test credentials (identifier + credential) for a pre-existing entity? (Tied to: Missing requirement — test credentials not available; Integration risk — no credentials in project adapter)\n"

