        "Q5: What is the feature entry page URL and the destination URL after successful action? (Tied to: Missing requirement — post-action navigation not specified; Integration risk — no application URL)\n"

        "Q6: Are there any session-related requirements (timeout, persist state, concurrent sessions, logout)? (Tied to: Missing requirement — session/state behavior not specified)\n"

        "Q7: What are the credential/code rules (minimum length, complexity, character requirements)? (Tied to: Missing requirement — credential/code rules not specified)\n"

        "Q8: Should the action failure for a non-existent entity reveal that the entity does not exist, or should it give a generic error to prevent entity enumeration? (Tied to: Negative scenario — non-existent entity behavior not specified; Missing requirement — security requirements)\n"

        "Q9: Is there a rate limiting or action lockout policy for repeated failed attempts? (Tied to: Missing requirement — rate limiting not specified; Negative scenario — repeated failed attempts)\n"

        "Q10: Are there accessibility requirements for the interaction form and error messages? (Tied to: Missing requirement — accessibility not addressed)\n"

    )

    art2 = write_stage_artifact(story_id, "grill/questions.md", questions_text)

